          "title": "You'll want to know: die Wanderung",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Wanderung — \"the hike, the walk\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Wanderung zum See dauert drei Stunden. The hike to the lake takes three hours."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Wanderungen."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Wanderung is built on wandern 'to hike, to wander' (EtymDB), inherited from Middle High German wandern and Old High German wantarōn."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
