              "text": "Auf halbem Weg rasten wir an einer Hütte. Halfway we stop for a rest at a hut."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Rast — the rest. Rasten sounds a little old-fashioned; people also say eine Pause machen."
            }
